yline\\\">From Rusokufo</p> <div class=\\\"a-section a-spacing-medium\\\"> <p id=\\\"pqv-ratings\\\" data-target=\\\"#averageCustomerReviews_feature_div\\\" class=\\\"a-spacing-none\\\"> 4.3 out of 5 stars, 5 ratings </p> <span class=\\\"a-declarative\\\" data-action=\\\"pqv-reviews-action\\\" data-pqv-reviews-action=\\\"{}\\\"> <a id=\\\"pqv-reviews\\\" data-target=\\\"#customer-reviews_feature_div\\\" class=\\\"a-link-normal\\\" href=\\\"https://www.amazon.es/dp/B0GS1TW9G5/\\\"> Customer reviews </a> </span> </div> <div class=\\\"a-section a-spacing-medium\\\"> <h2 id=\\\"pqv-price\\\"> Price </h2> <p class=\\\"a-spacing-small\\\"> <span class=\\\"a-text-bold\\\"> One-time purchase: €3.99 </span> ( €1.00 / count) </p> <p id=\\\"pqv-price-vat-message\\\" class=\\\"a-spacing-small\\\"> The prices of products sold on Amazon include VAT. Depending on your delivery address, VAT may vary at the checkout. For more information, click &lt;a href=\\\"https://www.amazon.es/-/es/gp/help/customer/display.html?ref_=hp_bc_nav&amp;nodeId=G7MYTK9H5NVW7QVW\\\"&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;. </p> <p class=\\\"a-text-italic\\\"> <span class=\\\"a-declarative\\\" data-action=\\\"pqv-buybox-action\\\" data-pqv-buybox-action=\\\"{}\\\"> <a id=\\\"pqv-buybox\\\" data-target=\\\"#buybox\\\" class=\\\"a-link-normal\\\" href=\\\"https://www.amazon.es/dp/B0GS1TW9G5/\\\"> Purchasing options </a> </span> </p> <p class=\\\"a-text-italic\\\"> <span class=\\\"a-declarative\\\" data-action=\\\"pqv-buying-options-action\\\" data-pqv-buying-options-action=\\\"{}\\\"> <a id=\\\"pqv-buying-options\\\" data-target=\\\"#dynamic-aod-ingress-box\\\" class=\\\"a-link-normal aok-hidden\\\" href=\\\"https://www.amazon.es/dp/B0GS1TW9G5/\\\"> Other sellers </a> </span> </p> <p class=\\\"a-text-italic\\\"> <span class=\\\"a-declarative\\\" data-action=\\\"pqv-unqualified-buybox-action\\\" data-pqv-unqualified-buybox-action=\\\"{}\\\"> <a id=\\\"pqv-unqualified-buybox\\\" data-target=\\\"#unqualifiedBuyBox\\\" class=\\\"a-link-normal aok-hidden\\\" href=\\\"https://www.amazon.es/dp/B0GS1TW9G5/\\\"> Other sellers </a> </span> </p> </div> <div id=\\\"pqv-feature-bullets\\\" data-target=\\\"#featurebullets_feature_div\\\" class=\\\"a-section a-spacing-medium\\\"> <h2 id=\\\"pqv-feature-bullets-heading\\\">About this Item</h2> <ul class=\\\"a-unordered-list a-vertical\\\"> <li><span class=\\\"a-list-item\\\">Set of 4 dandelion garden spikes in 2 different designs: 2 pieces with heart shaped flower head and 2 pieces with round flower head, original and detailed design for a varied garden decoration.</span></li> <li><span class=\\\"a-list-item\\\">HIGH QUALITY IRON WITH DURABLE AGED LOOK - Made with heavy duty iron, pre-rusted and absolutely weather resistant; sun and wind create a beautiful natural patina for timeless vintage charm.</span></li> <li><span class=\\\"a-list-item\\\">Realistic Dandelion Motif: Detailed metal dandelions symbolize hope and freedom, integrate harmoniously into any garden style and bring beautiful accents in pots and flower beds.</span></li> <li><span class=\\\"a-list-item\\\">SIMPLE USE WITHOUT ASSEMBLY: The garden spikes are ready to use, no assembly or tools required, just lock them in the soil, flower beds or pots and decorate.</span></li> <li><span class=\\\"a-list-item\\\">Versatile outdoor applications: ideal for garden, lawn, flower bed, terrace, balcony and flower pots; suitable as a year-round environmental decoration and as a loving gift for gardeners and nature lovers.</span></li> </ul> </div> <div id=\\\"pqv-description\\\" data-target=\\\"#productDescription_feature_div\\\" class=\\\"a-section a-spacing-medium\\\"> <h2 id=\\\"pqv-description-heading\\\">Product description</h2> <div> 1.Set of 4 dandelion garden spikes in 2 different designs: 2 pieces with heart-shaped flower head and 2 pieces with round flower head, original and detailed design for a varied garden decoration. ;2.HIGH QUALITY IRON WITH DURABLE ANTIQUE LOOK: Made with heavy duty iron, pre-rusted and absolutely weatherproof; sun and wind create a beautiful natural patina for timeless vintage charm. ;3.Realistic dandelion motif: detailed metal dandelions symbolize hope and freedom, harmoniously integrate into any garden style and bring beautiful accents in pots and flower beds. ;4.SIMPLE USE WITHOUT ASSEMBLY: The garden spikes are ready to use, no assembly or tools required, just clip them in the soil, flower beds or pots and decorate. ;5.Versatile outdoor applications: ideal for garden, lawn, flower bed, terrace, balcony and flower pots; suitable as a year-round environmental decoration and as a loving gift for gardeners and nature lovers. </div> </div> <div id=\\\"pqv-important-information\\\" data-target=\\\"#importantInformation_feature_div\\\" class=\\\"a-section a-spacing-medium\\\"> <h2 id=\\\"pqv-important-information-heading\\\">Important information</h2> <h3>header_for_buffet</h3> <h2>Disclaimer </h2><p>The price may include environmental recycling fees (EPR) where applicable. These fees support the collection and recycling of products at end of life. Learn more <a class=\\\"a-link-normal\\\" href=\\\"https://www.amazon.es/-/en/gp/help/customer/display.html\\\">here </a>. </p> <h3>header_for_buffet</h3> <h2>Your legal guarantee rights </h2><p>Every consumer in the EU benefits from at least 2 years of legal guarantee protection for any consumer good sold in the EU. <a class=\\\"a-link-normal\\\" href=\\\"https://www.amazon.es/-/en/gp/help/customer/display.html\\\">See More </a>. </p> </div> <div class=\\\"a-section a-spacing-medium\\\"> <span class=\\\"a-declarative\\\" data-action=\\\"pqv-report-issue-action\\\" data-pqv-report-issue-action=\\\"{}\\\"> <a id=\\\"pqv-report-issue\\\" data-target=\\\"#tellAmazon_feature_div\\\" class=\\\"a-link-normal\\\" href=\\\"https://www.amazon.es/dp/B0GS1TW9G5/\\\"> Report an issue with this product or seller </a> </span> </div> <div id=\\\"pqv-feedback\\\" class=\\\"a-section a-spacing-med"}